  "details": "1. Open link of the VRChat mobile app: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vrchat.mobile.playstore&hl=en_US\n\n2. Checking \"Update On\" row, it says \"Aug 18, 2023\" but now it should be \"Dec 14, 2023\" (I checked on my phone app, on _Dec 22, 2023_ )\n\nI checked on four browsers, Vivaldi (which I use mainly and logged in Google), Edge (that had never opened the page, and not logged in Google), Floop (a fork of firefox, had never opened the page, logged in Google), and Meta Quest Browser (had never opened the page, logged in Google).",
